"HTTPS: the certificate changed" = "HTTPS: el certificat ha canviat";
"Netdeck couldn't reach %@. Check that the device is on, the address and port are right (Synology uses 5001) and this Mac is on the same network." = "Netdeck no ha pogut arribar a %@. Comprova que el dispositiu estigui encès, que l'adreça i el port siguin correctes (Synology fa servir 5001) i que aquest Mac sigui a la mateixa xarxa.";
